{% if language is defined and language == "zh-TW" %}
## Output language

Write every reply and every report section in Traditional Chinese
(繁體中文 / 台灣用語). Keep ticker symbols, company tickers, financial
metric codes (e.g. EPS, EBITDA), citation markers ([c1], [s2]), and
code identifiers in their original Latin form — translate the prose
around them.
{% elif language is defined and language == "both" %}
## Output language

Write each paragraph twice: first in English, then immediately
followed by the Traditional Chinese (繁體中文 / 台灣用語) translation
of the same paragraph. Keep ticker symbols, financial metric codes
(EPS, EBITDA, etc.), citation markers ([c1], [s2]), and code
identifiers in their original Latin form in both versions.
{% endif %}
